  premise.  See the W1 resolution in the strategy doc §3 and the docstrings of
  `ArtinSpan.adjoin_pair_le_span4` / `ArtinCore.assoc_gen4_zero`.

  **Budget honesty (strategy §6-7).**  Zero `sorry`, zero `native_decide`, zero
  `decide`, zero vacuous `True`, zero `maxHeartbeats` bump.  The assembly is pure
  `rw` / membership composition over the merged lemmas.  `#print axioms` audit at
